## How this essay was made

Part of the creative contribution search. An argument critic and a contribution critic had different jobs. After three unsuccessful manuscripts, the series added an independent contribution check before drafting. Ten completed candidates were retained alongside seven unsuccessful attempts; this was not a ranking.

Campaign: `creative10-20260922` · Lineage: `essay-15`. The midterm ID is a blinded corpus label, not a rank.

Recorded model observations: `claude-opus-5-5`, `claude-opus-5-5 / high`, `gpt-6-astra`, `gpt-6-astra / high`, `gpt-6-astra / medium`. These identify recorded configurations, not independent backend attestation.

